melody:
# Chorus (originally in cut time; written here with quarter-note beats)
You made me love you, I did-n't wan-na do it, I did-n't wan-na do it,
E4 B4(2) A4 G4(2) F#4. F#4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ D4 E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ D4.
You made me want you, And all the time you knew it, I guess you al-ways knew it.
r/ D5. D5 B4 A4(2) B4(2) r/ G#4/ A4/ G#4/ A4/ G4/ E4/ C4/ r/ G#4/ A4/ G#4/ A4/ G4/ E4/ C4/
You made me hap-py some-times, You made me glad,
r/ A4. Ab4 A4/ Bb4/ ~Bb4/ A4 G4/ ~G4/ E4. r/ E4. E4 Eb4/ D4/ ~D4(4)
But there were times, dear, You made me feel so bad.
r/ D4. F#4 A4/ D5/ ~D5 D5(2) B4/ A4/ ~A4 B4 A4/ Ab4 G4/ ~G4(4)
You made me sigh for, I did-n't wan-na tell you, I did-n't wan-na tell you,
E4 B4(2) A4 G4(2) F#4. F#4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ D4 E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ E4/ F4/ D4.
I want some love that's true, Yes I do, 'Deed I do, You know I do.
r/ D5. D5 B4 A4(2) B4(2) G#4 B4/ A4/ G#4 B4/ A4/ G#4/ A4/ B4/ A4/ G#4(2)
Gim-me, gim-me what I cry for, You know you got the brand of kiss-es that I'd die for,
A4 Bb4 A4 B4 A4/ Bb4 A4/ ~A4/ E4 E4/ D4/ D4/ F#4/ F#4/ A4/ A4/ C5/ C5/ D5/ E5 D5/ ~D5/ C5.
You know you made me love you.
